<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Présentation Soutenance — Séries Temporelles (KO vs PEP)</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0B0F19;
            --bg-card: #151D2E;
            --bg-card-hover: #1E293B;
            --ko-red: #E41A1C;
            --pep-blue: #0080FF;
            --gold: #F59E0B;
            --green: #10B981;
            --text-main: #F8FAFC;
            --text-muted: #94A3B8;
            --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --border-active: rgba(228, 26, 28, 0.5);
            --font-main: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            line-height: 1.5;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Barre de navigation supérieure */
        .topbar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 60px;
            background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 24px;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .badge-duopoly {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .dot-ko { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ko-red); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--ko-red); }
        .dot-pep { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--pep-blue); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--pep-blue); }

        .nav-controls {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--ko-red);
            border-color: var(--ko-red);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #C8102E;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(228, 26, 28, 0.4);
        }

        .slide-counter {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        /* Conteneur principal des diapositives */
        .deck-container {
            margin-top: 60px;
            height: calc(100vh - 60px);
            width: 100vw;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .slide {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            padding: 40px 60px;
            display: none;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .slide.active {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* En-tête de diapositive */
        .slide-header {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .slide-category {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .slide-title {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-main);
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        /* Corps de la diapositive */
        .slide-body {
            flex: 1;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 30px;
            align-items: stretch;
        }

        .slide-body.full-width {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        /* Cartes de contenu */
        .content-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .bullet-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .bullet-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-main);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .badge-tag {
            font-size: 10px;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .badge-tag.gold { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: var(--gold); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4); }
        .badge-tag.green { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: var(--green); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4); }
        .badge-tag.red { background: rgba(228, 26, 28, 0.15); color: var(--ko-red); border: 1px solid rgba(228, 26, 28, 0.4); }
        .badge-tag.blue { background: rgba(0, 128, 255, 0.15); color: var(--pep-blue); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 128, 255, 0.4); }

        .bullet-text {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Conteneur d'image */
        .image-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .image-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--ko-red);
            transform: scale(1.01);
        }

        .image-card img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .zoom-hint {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 12px;
            right: 12px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Tableaux de données */
        .table-container {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        th {
            background: rgba(228, 26, 28, 0.2);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(228, 26, 28, 0.4);
        }

        td {
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        }

        tr:hover td {
            color: var(--text-main);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        }

        .highlight-val {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
        }

        .takeaway-card {
            margin-top: 14px;
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Tiroir des notes de l'orateur */
        .notes-drawer {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: #020617;
            border-top: 2px solid var(--ko-red);
            padding: 16px 30px;
            transform: translateY(100%);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 1001;
            box-shadow: 0 -10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            max-height: 250px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .notes-drawer.open {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .notes-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .notes-title {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--gold);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .notes-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #E2E8F0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Lightbox modal pour zoom image */
        .lightbox {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 2000;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .lightbox.active {
            display: flex;
        }

        .lightbox img {
            max-width: 92vw;
            max-height: 92vh;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        }

        /* Grille overview */
        .overview-grid {
            position: fixed;
            top: 60px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            z-index: 999;
            padding: 30px;
            display: none;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .overview-grid.active {
            display: grid;
        }

        .overview-thumb {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .overview-thumb:hover {
            border-color: var(--ko-red);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .overview-thumb-title {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        /* Mode impression / PDF */
        @media print {
            .topbar, .notes-drawer, .lightbox, .overview-grid, .zoom-hint {
                display: none !important;
            }
            body, .deck-container {
                background: #FFFFFF !important;
                color: #000000 !important;
                height: auto !important;
                overflow: visible !important;
                margin: 0 !important;
            }
            .slide {
                display: flex !important;
                opacity: 1 !important;
                position: relative !important;
                page-break-after: always !important;
                height: 100vh !important;
                padding: 30px !important;
                background: #FFFFFF !important;
                color: #000000 !important;
            }
            .content-card, .table-container, .image-card {
                background: #F8FAFC !important;
                border: 1px solid #CBD5E1 !important;
                color: #000000 !important;
                box-shadow: none !important;
            }
            .slide-title, .bullet-title {
                color: #0F172A !important;
            }
            .bullet-text, td {
                color: #334155 !important;
            }
            th {
                background: #E2E8F0 !important;
                color: #0F172A !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Barre supérieure de navigation -->
    <header class="topbar">
        <div class="brand">
            <span class="badge-duopoly">
                <span class="dot-ko"></span> KO
                <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">&bull;</span>
                <span class="dot-pep"></span> PEP
            </span>
            <span>TEK-UP &mdash; Soutenance Séries Temporelles</span>
        </div>

        <div class="nav-controls">
            <button class="btn" onclick="prevSlide()" title="Précédent (Flèche Gauche)">&#8592; Précédent</button>
            <span class="slide-counter" id="slideIndicator">1 / 24</span>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="nextSlide()" title="Suivant (Flèche Droite ou Espace)">Suivant &#8594;</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="toggleOverview()" title="Vue Grille (Touche O)">&#9638; Vue d'ensemble</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="toggleNotes()" title="Notes Orateur (Touche N)">&#128221; Notes Orateur</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="toggleFullscreen()" title="Plein Écran (Touche F)">&#x26F6; Plein Écran</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="window.print()" title="Exporter en PDF (Ctrl+P)">&#128424; Exporter PDF</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Grille d'aperçu de toutes les diapositives -->
    <div class="overview-grid" id="overviewGrid"></div>

    <!-- Conteneur des diapositives -->
    <main class="deck-container" id="deckContainer">

        <!-- SLIDE 1 -->
        <section class="slide active" id="slide-1" data-id="1">
            <div class="slide-header">
                <div class="slide-category">MINI-PROJET SÉRIES TEMPORELLES — TEK-UP</div>
                <h1 class="slide-title">Modélisation, Prévision et Diagnostic de Séries Temporelles Multidimensionnelles</h1>
            </div>
    
            <div class="slide-body full-width">
                <div class="content-card" style="justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; padding: 40px; border-color: rgba(228,26,28,0.4);">
                    <div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px;">PROJET DE FIN D'ÉTUDES DE MODULE</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 16px; max-width: 900px; line-height: 1.3;">Modélisation, Prévision et Diagnostic de Séries Temporelles Multidimensionnelles</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 30px; max-width: 800px;">De l'ARIMA classique aux réseaux de neurones, en passant par la cointégration, la volatilité conditionnelle et l'IA générative</div>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                        <span class="badge-tag red" style="font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 14px;">Coca-Cola Company (KO)</span>
                        <span class="badge-tag blue" style="font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 14px;">PepsiCo, Inc. (PEP)</span>
                        <span class="badge-tag gold" style="font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 14px;">Données Réelles 2019-2024</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-top: 16px; width: 100%; max-width: 600px;">
                        Enseignant : Ahmed DHOUIBI | Date limite : 12 Octobre 2026 | Barème : 20 Points
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
        </section>
    
        <!-- SLIDE 2 -->
        <section class="slide " id="slide-2" data-id="2">
            <div class="slide-header">
                <div class="slide-category">1. CADRE MÉTHODOLOGIQUE & DONNÉES</div>
                <h1 class="slide-title">Contexte Économique & Justification du Duopole KO vs PEP</h1>
            </div>
    
            <div class="slide-body">
                <div class="content-card">
        
                    <div class="bullet-item">
                        <div class="bullet-title">
                            <span class="badge-tag gold">Fondamental</span>
                            Justification en une phrase (Exigence Section 1 du barème) :
                        </div>
                        <div class="bullet-text">« Nous avons sélectionné le duopole historique Coca-Cola (KO) et PepsiCo (PEP) car ces deux multinationales partagent des fondamentaux économiques et sectoriels très proches, constituant un cas d'école idéal pour étudier la co-évolution, la cointégration de long terme, la transmission de volatilité croisée et confronter l'efficience des marchés aux modèles neuronaux. »</div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div class="bullet-item">
                        <div class="bullet-title">
                            <span class="badge-tag blue">Pertinence</span>
                            Pourquoi ce duopole est idéal :
                        </div>
                        <div class="bullet-text">• Deux leaders mondiaux du secteur agroalimentaire des boissons et snacks.<br>• Mêmes chocs macroéconomiques (taux de la Fed, inflation mondiale, coûts de l'aluminium et du sucre).<br>• Même calendrier boursier au NYSE : zéro valeur manquante (NaN = 0).</div>
                    </div>
            
                </div>
                <div class="content-card" style="border-color: rgba(0, 128, 255, 0.4);">
                    <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--pep-blue); margin-bottom: 8px;">Caractéristiques des Données Collectées</div>
        
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: 8px;">
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase;">Fournisseur</div>
                        <div style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500;">Yahoo Finance (finance.yahoo.com)</div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: 8px;">
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase;">Période</div>
                        <div style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500;">02/01/2019 au 30/12/2024 (6 années pleines > 5 ans)</div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: 8px;">
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase;">Observations</div>
                        <div style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500;">1508 jours de cotation effectifs sur le NYSE</div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: 8px;">
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase;">Variable cible</div>
                        <div style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500;">Adj Close (Cours ajusté des dividendes et splits)</div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: 8px;">
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase;">Variables dérivées</div>
                        <div style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500;">Log-rendements, Volatilité réalisée 20j, SMA 20/50, RSI 14</div>
                    </div>
            
                </div>
            </div>
        
        </section>
    
        <!-- SLIDE 3 -->
        <section class="slide " id="slide-3" data-id="3">
            <div class="slide-header">
                <div class="slide-category">1. CADRE MÉTHODOLOGIQUE & DONNÉES</div>
                <h1 class="slide-title">Découpage Chronologique Strict : 90% Train / 10% Test (Zéro Fuite)</h1>
            </div>
    
            <div class="slide-body">
                <div class="content-card">
        
                    <div class="bullet-item">
                        <div class="bullet-title">
                            <span class="badge-tag green">Conforme</span>
                            Règle Absolue Anti-Fuite (Zero Data Leakage) :
                        </div>
                        <div class="bullet-text">• Aucun mélange aléatoire (<code>shuffle=False</code> formel).<br>• <strong>90 % Apprentissage (1357 obs)</strong> : du 03/01/2019 au 23/05/2024.<br>• <strong>10 % Test Hors-Échantillon (151 obs)</strong> : du 24/05/2024 au 30/12/2024.</div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div class="bullet-item">
                        <div class="bullet-title">
                            <span class="badge-tag gold">Rigueur</span>
                            Calibrage Séquentiel :
                        </div>
                        <div class="bullet-text">Tous les transformateurs (<code>MinMaxScaler</code>, standardisations) sont strictement ajustés sur le Train set, puis appliqués de façon séquentielle au Test.</div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div class="bullet-item">
                        <div class="bullet-title">
                            <span class="badge-tag red">Marché</span>
                            Événements Historiques Visibles :
                        </div>
                        <div class="bullet-text">• Krach sanitaire Covid-19 en mars 2020 (-37% sur KO).<br>• Choc inflationniste et resserrement monétaire de la Fed en 2022.</div>
                    </div>
            
                </div>
                <div class="image-card" onclick="openLightbox('presentation/figures/fig01_prices_history.png')">
                    <img src="presentation/figures/fig01_prices_history.png" alt="Découpage Chronologique Strict : 90% Train / 10% Test (Zéro Fuite)">
                    <span class="zoom-hint">&#128269; Cliquez pour agrandir</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        
        </section>
    
        <!-- SLIDE 4 -->
        <section class="slide " id="slide-4" data-id="4">
            <div class="slide-header">
                <div class="slide-category">2. ANALYSE EXPLORATOIRE (EDA)</div>
                <h1 class="slide-title">Log-Rendements Journaliers & Phénomène de Volatility Clustering</h1>
            </div>
    
            <div class="slide-body">
                <div class="content-card">
        
                    <div class="bullet-item">
                        <div class="bullet-title">
                            <span class="badge-tag gold">Formule</span>
                            Définition du Log-Rendement Journalier :
                        </div>
                        <div class="bullet-text"><code>r_t = 100 × ln(P_t / P_{t-1})</code><br>Avantage : Additivité temporelle et approximation fidèle du rendement arithmétique.</div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div class="bullet-item">
                        <div class="bullet-title">
                            <span class="badge-tag blue">Observation</span>
                            Faits Stylisés de Mandelbrot :
                        </div>
                        <div class="bullet-text">• Moyenne quasi-nulle (+0.031% KO, +0.033% PEP).<br>• <strong>Regroupement de volatilité (Volatility Clustering)</strong> : les fortes variations sont suivies de fortes variations.</div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div class="bullet-item">
                        <div class="bullet-title">
                            <span class="badge-tag red">Théorie</span>
